    "wclIdSpaceNote": "A Warcraft Logs combatantinfo talentTree entry is { id, rank, nodeID }. The same equivalence M10-C, M11-A4 and M11-B2 recorded — `id` equals trait_data_t::id_trait_node_entry and `nodeID` equals trait_data_t::id_node — is EXPECTED for Brewmaster but NOT yet corroborated: no Brewmaster capture is committed (M11-C1 pins authority only). The corroboration belongs to the milestone that commits Brewmaster evidence; until then it is not claimed.",
